@startuml SD-6
!include ../_style.iuml
title SD-6 (Software level, CSMS) — Session started at the Charge Point with an RFID card\nPrecondition: Charge Point in service · System view: AD-6 · State: STM-1, STM-8
footer Owner: Ngô Văn Minh Trí (WP2) · v1.0 · 01/11/2026 · names = code (apps/csms/src) · left gate = Charge Point [OCPP 1.6J, WSS]

participant "«component»\n<u>:OcppHandlers</u>" as H
participant "«component»\n<u>:DriverChargingService</u>" as D
participant "«component»\n<u>:SessionsService</u>" as S
participant "«component»\n<u>:ReconciliationService</u>" as R
participant "«component»\n<u>:ChargeSettlementService</u>" as CS

== Driver taps a card ==
[-> H ++ : Authorize {idTag}
H -> D ++ : authorizeAppTag(idTag, ctx)
D --> H -- : null (not an app tag)
H -> S ++ : authorize(idTag) : AuthorizeStatus
S --> H -- : Accepted (card active) | Blocked | Invalid (unknown)
[<-- H -- : Authorize.conf {idTagInfo.status}

== Charge Point starts the transaction ==
[-> H ++ : StartTransaction {connectorId, idTag, meterStart, timestamp}
H -> S ++ : onStartTransaction(req, ctx)
S -> S : classifyIdTag(chargePointId, idTag)
alt online card linked to a Driver
  S -> S : payment_mode = csms_billed
else wallet card
  S -> S : payment_mode = station_wallet\n(the card pays at the Charge Point)
else unknown tag, inactive card or free-vend tag
  S -> S : payment_mode = unattributed
  S -> R ++ : recordUnknownIdTag(sessionId, idTag)
  R --> S --
end
S -> S : create session
hnote over S : {session.status = active}
S --> H -- : transactionId
[<-- H -- : StartTransaction.conf {transactionId, Accepted}
note right of H : always Accepted: the session\nhas already happened (ADR-0012)

... MeterValues until the Driver stops at the Charge Point ...

[-> H ++ : StopTransaction {transactionId, meterStop, timestamp}
H -> S ++ : onStopTransaction(req, ctx)
S -> S : Running → closed → reconciled | review\n(as in SD-1b)
S --> H --
H -> D ++ : onStopped(transactionId)
D -> CS ++ : settle(sessionId)
alt payment_mode = csms_billed
  CS --> D : posted (debit Driver credit, points, statement)
else station_wallet
  CS --> D : ineligible (price recorded only, no debit)
else unattributed
  CS --> D : ineligible (listed for the Operator, UC-OPS-05)
end
deactivate CS
D --> H --
[<-- H -- : StopTransaction.conf {Accepted}
note over H, CS : Code gaps (Trí): settle() only posts sessions with origin = app_qr, so online-card sessions are not debited yet;\nfree-vend tags are still classified as payment_mode = free (DB brief B6 → unattributed).
@enduml
